node_modules/
.DS_Store

# python bytecode from src/search.py
src/__pycache__/

# YOUR accounts, not part of a tool other people install. spec/sources.json
# ships; this does not. deadreckon commits its copy because deadreckon IS the
# record — here it would publish addresses to everyone who runs npx starreckon.
spec/identity.json

# Tool sandboxes and reports. Stryker copies the WHOLE TREE into
# .stryker-tmp/sandbox-*/ to mutate it, and 137 of those files were committed
# in acc6bd0 by a `git add -A`. A second stale copy of every source file in the
# repo is worse than clutter: grep returns two answers, knip reads the sandbox
# as real code, and a reader cannot tell which version is the program.
.stryker-tmp/
reports/mutation/
.jazzer/
